        "created_at": "2018-12-26T15:58:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When a Mission Card flips it stays in play in your play area (since there is no direction to move it anywhere else).</p>\n<p>The Mission \"To Hope For the Dawn\" is an exception to this rule since it explicitly says \"flip this card and put it in your hand.:</p>",
